       packet  socket.   To  get  packets  only  from a specific interface use
       bbiinndd(2) specifying an address in  a  _s_t_r_u_c_t  _s_o_c_k_a_d_d_r___l_l  to  bind  the
       packet  socket to an interface.  Fields used for binding are _s_l_l___f_a_m_i_l_y
